Subject: [RFC 2/3] Bluetooth: Implement Intel specific device initialization
Date: Mon, 10 Sep 2012 14:29:09 -0700
Message-ID: <3426194.LHJ1eab2pX@tedd-ubuntu>
MIME-Version: 1.0
